{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_ask

    The one open question after a visit, «What were you left to ask?»: what they write goes to whoever receives them,
    whose face is on the button, with how soon they answer. Once asked, that it was passed on, and «Anything else?».
    It goes inside a form: on the wall alone, or first in the survey of the band.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "¿Qué les quedó por preguntar?", "help": "Lo que no dio tiempo a preguntar.",
        "sent": "", "justsent": false, "button": "Enviar a Lucía", "face": {"photo": "", "initials": "LM"},
        "reply": "Lucía les contesta por correo, normalmente en dos días laborables.", "sending": "Enviando…"
    }
}}
<div class="pregunta-abierta" id="pregunta">
    {{#sent}}<p class="ya-pasado"{{#justsent}} role="status" tabindex="-1" data-recien{{/justsent}}><span class="marca-hecho" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{sent}}</p>{{/sent}}
    <label class="pregunta-titulo" for="pregunta-texto">{{title}}</label>
    <p class="ayuda-campo" id="pregunta-ayuda">{{help}}</p>
    <textarea id="pregunta-texto" name="question" maxlength="4000" rows="3" aria-describedby="pregunta-ayuda pregunta-contesta"></textarea>
    <div class="enviar-pregunta">
        <button class="boton principal con-cara" type="submit" name="send" value="1" data-sending="{{sending}}">{{#face}}<span class="cara-boton" aria-hidden="true">{{#photo}}<img src="{{photo}}" alt="">{{/photo}}{{^photo}}{{initials}}{{/photo}}</span>{{/face}}{{button}}</button>
        <p class="contesta" id="pregunta-contesta">{{reply}}</p>
    </div>
</div>
